+# Transport Compression Codec
+
+This project has no current, unconflicted decision on the transport compression codec: two recorded decisions disagree — one specifying gzip and a later one specifying zstd — and both remain active with neither retired or reconciled, so nothing is recorded as the project's settled choice at this time.
